<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Account settings live in four windows — Account, Profile, Away and User Modes — all reachable from the File > Account menu, the Start menu's Account group, or the toolbar. The status-bar account widget opens Account directly."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_status_user}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Status-Bar Account Widget")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "The widget shows your current nickname and state: Guest, Identified, or Away. Click it to open the Account window. The adjacent away button quickly toggles between away and back without opening anything."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lock}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Account")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Register claims your current nickname with NickServ. Identify logs this session into an already registered nickname. The window adapts to the nickname state: unregistered nicknames show Register, registered nicknames show Identify and Drop registration, and NickServ password errors stay inline. Ghost session disconnects a stale session after you enter that nickname and its password."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_dialog_profile}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Profile")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Use the Profile window to change your nickname or edit your bio. Nickname changes are validated before the confirmation dialog opens. The bio is shown in /whois and is limited to 200 characters with a live counter."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_dialog_away}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Away")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Use the Away window to set a custom away message or clear away status. Away state is visible in user lists and whois output."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_dialog_user_modes}>{dgettext("help_ui", "User Modes")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "User Modes currently exposes the wallops (+w) setting, which opts you in to operator broadcast messages. Further IRC user modes land in this window."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Command Mapping")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    <code>/ns register</code>, <code>/ns identify</code>, <code>/ns drop</code>
    {dgettext("help_ui", "and")} <code>/ns ghost</code>
  </li>
  <li><code>/nick</code> {dgettext("help_ui", "for nickname changes")}</li>
  <li><code>/bio</code> {dgettext("help_ui", "for profile text")}</li>
  <li><code>/away</code> {dgettext("help_ui", "for presence")}</li>
  <li><code>/umode +w</code> {dgettext("help_ui", "or")} <code>/umode -w</code></li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_ui", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-identity-presence">
    {dgettext("help_ui", "Identity & Presence")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="nickserv">{dgettext("help_ui", "NickServ Overview")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-ns">{dgettext("help_ui", "/ns")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-nick">{dgettext("help_ui", "/nick")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-away">{dgettext("help_ui", "/away")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-bio">{dgettext("help_ui", "/bio")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-umode">{dgettext("help_ui", "/umode")}</.help_link>
</p>
